# SHA-256 of the natural voice files and the speech engine the builds bundle (code/shared/docs/voices.md). One line
# each: <sha256>  <file name>. Never change a line: a fixed voice goes out as a new release (voices-2) with new names.
# The apps download a voice only when its line is here. Every build fails when an engine file doesn't match its line
# here, or has none. The "Publish voices" workflow adds the voice lines once the voices are published.
#
# The speech engine, sherpa-onnx 1.13.8 from github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/releases/tag/v1.13.8 (trust on first use:
# upstream publishes no signatures; the Linux line was also found independently by the round 19 Linux review).
